Subject: [PATCH 1214/3799] soh: rename func_8086EE94 -> BgBombwall_SetupBroken

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: selects the broken display list, tears down the collision and clears actionFunc so nothing runs again.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Bombwall/z_bg_bombwall.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Bombwall/z_bg_bombwall.c | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Bombwall/z_bg_bombwall.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Bombwall/z_bg_bombwall.c
